<title>USA: PIA Merchandising sets 1-mln-shr buyback.</title>
<headline>PIA Merchandising sets 1-mln-shr buyback.</headline>
<dateline>IRVINE, Calif. 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>PIA Merchandising Services Inc said Friday its board had approved a plan to repurchase up to one million of its shares.</p>
<p>The company said the shares would be repurchased from time to time in the open market, depending on market conditions. The program will be funded by working capital, PIA said.</p>
<p>As of September 30, 1996, the company had about six million shares outstanding.</p>
</text>
